   "Now look up. Above it hang skeletons and models of other whales and dolphins, so that it seems to swim among them. For decades, Hope's skeleton hung above this model, the bones and the body in one room. She was taken down in 2015, and two years later she was hung again at the front of the museum. The model is a few metres longer than she is. Hope, in her defence, is the real thing.",
